### Caso exitoso - Pago aprobado
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "sourceAccount": "ACC-001",
  "destinationAccount": "ACC-XYZ",
  "amount": 100.50,
  "concept": "Pago de servicio"
}

### Caso exitoso - Sin concepto (Option.none)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-002",
  "sourceAccount": "ACC-001",
  "destinationAccount": "ACC-XYZ",
  "amount": 50.00
}

### Error de validación - Amount negativo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-003",
  "sourceAccount": "ACC-001",
  "destinationAccount": "ACC-XYZ",
  "amount": -10.00,
  "concept": "Pago inválido"
}

### Error de validación - Amount cero
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-004",
  "sourceAccount": "ACC-001",
  "destinationAccount": "ACC-XYZ",
  "amount": 0,
  "concept": "Pago cero"
}

### Error de negocio - Saldo insuficiente (ACC-002)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-005",
  "sourceAccount": "ACC-002",
  "destinationAccount": "ACC-XYZ",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "concept": "Pago con saldo insuficiente"
}
